    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1319_4537.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fruntlich willig dienst, sambt was
<lb n="2"/>wir eeren liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermuegend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovorn</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">from</unclear> fuersichtig ersam wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>guot frund unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getruew</unclear> lieb Eydtgnossen.
<lb n="5"/>Wir sind von <persName resp="#ner">Petter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wetlichen</unclear></persName> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyebher</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>so von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">naher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">purtig</unclear> unnd sich nun <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meer</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drißig</unclear> jar by unser statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">redlich</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyse</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">enthallten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hindersessen</unclear> angenomen, berichtet,
<lb n="10"/>wie das gott der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allmechtig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aller</unclear> juengst
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> schwöster <persName resp="#ner">Magdalena Wett-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lichin</unclear></persName> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synen</unclear> göttlichen gnaden erfordert.
<lb n="13"/>Mitt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderthonigem</unclear> pitt. Diewyle sy on lybs-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">todes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verscheiden</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dardurch</unclear> ir
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlaßenschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> in und die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uberigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syne</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschwuestergiten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefallen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wölltind</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inne</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>umb erlangung deßen so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßnachen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehören</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchte</unclear>, gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> fuerschrifft be-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> syn. Wann nun wir diß syn pitt
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unzimlich</unclear> erachtet. So gelangt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innamen</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genants</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hindersessen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Petter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wettlichen</unclear></persName>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> fruntlichs pitten an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear>, ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölltind</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllichs</unclear> erbfals wegen ob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> deß
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orths</unclear> etwas beschwerlichs fuerfallen guenstige
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befuerderung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> von
<lb n="26"/>rechts wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehörig</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkeits</unclear> wegen
<lb n="27"/>wie wir ouch das wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wußend</unclear> ir sonst deß
<lb n="28"/>geneigten willens, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhuelfen</unclear> syn. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inmaaßen</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gespueren</unclear> diser unnser fuerschrifft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genoßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hab</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1319_4538.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/>das sind wir gaegn üch Inen souelichen und anndern
<lb n="31"/>fürfallenden sachen hinwider geneigt Uns
<lb n="32"/>damitt sambtlichen gotlichen gnaden beware-
<lb n="33"/>ende daten <origDate when="1595" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Mentags den. 1. st. Septembris
<lb n="34"/>anno etc. 95</origDate>
<lb n="35"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath.
<lb n="36"/>der statt Zuerich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1319_4539.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1319_4540.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="37"/>Den frommen fuersichtigen er-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sammen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="39"/>meister unnd rath der statt
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> Gallen</orgName>, unnsern in-
<lb n="41"/>sonders guoten fründen und ge-
<lb n="42"/>trüwen lieben eydtgnossen etc.
</p>
